# Servo on CuBit (docs/servo-port.md): cubitshell renders the pages listed in
# @nvme:0/servo/pages with SWGL into memory and reports each frame. Fonts
# come from @nvme:0/fonts; the host serves one page over HTTP and one over
# HTTPS (trusted through the test CA installed as the trust store).
(startup v1
  (start "logstore.svc" (priority 5))
  (start "clock.svc" (priority 5))
  (start "cubitshell.app" (priority 3) (network approve-declared))
)
